      "claim": "Tanshinone IIB, a polycyclic diterpenoid natural product, achieved only about 30% brain/plasma levels in rats and was classified as poor penetration due to P-gp and Mrp1 efflux; this is the most structurally transferable direct CNS-exposure evidence for the query diterpenoid and supports a fail prediction.",
